Description: Persist preferences when the preferences dialog closes
 Write changed settings immediately when the preferences dialog is closed,
 instead of relying solely on a later clean application shutdown. This avoids
 losing API configuration when the running process is replaced or terminated.
Author: Jannik Winkel <jannik.winkel@kiney.de>
Forwarded: no
